  "analysis": {
    "summary": "InkTV posts near-daily news and reaction videos, mostly about GTA 6 and Modern Warfare 4, plus wider gaming industry talk. Every thumbnail uses the same frame: the host on the right in a backwards cap and headphones, reacting, a game image on the left, and a short yellow-orange line at the bottom.",
    "niche": "GTA 6 and Call of Duty news and reactions",
    "styleTraits": [
      {
        "title": "The host as a fixed anchor",
        "detail": "The host sits on the right in a black cap and headphones, in front of a red-lit studio, with a hand on his mouth or chin or a shocked face. It works like a news presenter: the same person, a new story each day."
      },
      {
        "title": "Yellow-orange reaction lines",
        "detail": "The text is one short reaction in bold condensed yellow-to-orange letters: 'NOBODY IS READY!', 'THIS IS STRANGE...', 'NEVER BEEN DONE!', 'I ALREADY QUIT...'. It gives the mood, not the facts."
      },
      {
        "title": "Official art on the left",
        "detail": "The left side uses official GTA 6 or Modern Warfare 4 images: Lucia, a Vice City blimp, the 'VI' logo over a globe, a masked soldier. The game is recognised at a glance."
      },
      {
        "title": "Collages for list videos",
        "detail": "List videos replace the art with a grid of images, like four vehicles around a GTA VI logo for 'ALL VEHICLES', so the scope of the video is visible."
      }
    ],
    "standouts": [
      {
        "id": "axG8WudR8G4",
        "why": "About 127,000 views, 2.2 times the median. The Earth from space with a glowing 'VI' over it, the host covering his mouth, and 'NOBODY IS READY!'. The scale of the image matches the claim that the game is taking over the world."
      },
      {
        "id": "PgicVKHmupc",
        "why": "About 112,000 views, 1.9 times the median. Lucia hanging from a parachute on the left, the host with his hand on his chin, and 'THIS IS STRANGE...'. A vague, curious line next to a leak story probably invites viewers to find out what is strange."
      },
      {
        "id": "TeDZcAX0KDI",
        "why": "About 157,000 views, 2.7 times the median, the highest in the sample. Two characters from the Modern Warfare 4 campaign, the host with a hand over his mouth and 'BIGGEST MOMENTS'. Reaction compilations right after a launch may draw people who have not played yet."
      }
    ],
    "lessons": [
      "If you post often on the same topics, a fixed frame with you in the same spot makes every upload recognisable.",
      "Let the text give the emotion ('THIS IS STRANGE...') and the title give the facts.",
      "Use official art from the game when the news is about the game; it is recognised faster than gameplay.",
      "Off-topic industry videos sat at 0.2 to 0.3 times the median here; viewers came mostly for GTA 6 and Call of Duty."
    ],
    "experiment": "For your next news video, try a thumbnail where your reaction line is vague and curious ('THIS IS STRANGE...') against one that states the news ('NEW MAP LEAK'). Keep the image identical.",
